@page "/"

<PageTitle>Day 4 Practice</PageTitle>

<h1>Day 4 Practice: Fluxor -- Actions and Reducers</h1>

<p class="lead">Three exercises to practice Fluxor state management.</p>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Practice 1: Counter</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Guided build. Add a Reset action, its reducer, and wire the component. (15 min)</p>
                <a href="/counter" class="btn btn-primary">Start Practice 1</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Practice 2: Todo List</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Independent practice. Build Add, Remove, and Toggle actions with reducers. (25 min)</p>
                <a href="/todo" class="btn btn-primary">Start Practice 2</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Practice 3: Cart Refactor</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Challenge. Complete the shopping cart Fluxor store from Day 3. (10 min)</p>
                <a href="/products" class="btn btn-primary">Start Practice 3</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
